WEBVTT

00:29.988 --> 00:31.740
What are you doing, Orihime?

00:32.615 --> 00:34.783
Yeah...
I was just thinking that

00:34.784 --> 00:37.454
this flower kind of reminds me
of Kurosaki.

00:37.704 --> 00:38.955
What? It does?

00:39.289 --> 00:40.706
Ichigo's as red
like that flower,

00:40.707 --> 00:42.167
but isn't he
more like that one?

00:43.043 --> 00:44.669
Huh, I think you're right.

00:44.794 --> 00:46.629
Well, it doesn't really matter
which one he is.

00:46.921 --> 00:49.090
We can talk about Ichigo later.

00:49.549 --> 00:50.508
Anyway, let's get going.

00:50.884 --> 00:53.887
We need finish seeing everything
by half past the hour.

00:54.220 --> 00:56.097
Oh yes, you're right...

00:56.306 --> 00:57.515
Yup, I am!

00:57.932 --> 01:00.101
Double period classes
are such a pain!

01:10.528 --> 01:13.114
<i>Kurosaki's heart must surely be...</i>

01:22.207 --> 01:24.042
<i>...the same color as that flower.</i>

01:25.168 --> 01:29.881
<i>Warm, kind and shining its light
brightly on everything around it...</i>

01:30.924 --> 01:32.467
<i>In order to protect everyone.</i>

01:36.096 --> 01:37.430
<i>That's why I decided...</i>

01:39.516 --> 01:41.643
<i>Kurosaki, I-!</i>

01:44.062 --> 01:47.941
THE CALAMITY

01:49.818 --> 01:52.403
<i>I've lived my way full of shame</i>

01:52.404 --> 01:56.782
<i>"Envy" comes from the ways
of the eventual end</i>

01:56.783 --> 01:59.326
<i>The ambiguous balance</i>

01:59.327 --> 02:02.163
<i>I want to cut ties at once</i>

02:03.456 --> 02:04.999
<i>It's too late to back down now</i>

02:05.000 --> 02:06.250
<i>Before this senile body dies</i>

02:06.251 --> 02:08.002
<i>My shadow will fade away soon, but</i>

02:08.003 --> 02:10.212
<i>Even if I disappear, my journey won't stop</i>

02:10.213 --> 02:11.714
<i>Uncertain days, certain endings</i>

02:11.715 --> 02:13.382
<i>My stories fill the in-betweens</i>

02:13.383 --> 02:16.135
<i>Beyond the wall blocking my way,
there is a calm morning</i>

02:16.136 --> 02:20.432
<i>Like the rising sun,
I stand with the wind at my back</i>

02:20.557 --> 02:24.601
<i>A burst of hope?</i>

02:24.602 --> 02:26.895
<i>Break through an endless night</i>

02:26.896 --> 02:31.900
<i>Show the sun waiting
at the end of darkness</i>

02:31.901 --> 02:34.945
<i>The promise is yet to be fulfilled</i>

02:34.946 --> 02:38.532
<i>but I stand in solitude not to let it go</i>

02:38.533 --> 02:41.410
<i>At the moment,
I'm connecting numerous lights</i>

02:41.411 --> 02:45.123
<i>to form a constellation
that paves tomorrow</i>

02:45.790 --> 02:49.668
<i>Even if the rain clouds
hide the night sky away</i>

02:49.669 --> 02:53.131
<i>there certainly is a flame in my heart</i>

02:53.465 --> 02:58.303
<i>God is no longer reliable</i>

02:58.470 --> 03:03.183
<i>I glance up towards the silver lining</i>

03:03.308 --> 03:09.605
<i>The destiny of bursting fate</i>

03:09.606 --> 03:11.900
BLEACH THOUSAND-YEAR BLOOD WAR

03:25.246 --> 03:28.917
Spiritual Pressure that changes
48 times per second...

03:30.794 --> 03:32.087
Put another way...

03:32.587 --> 03:36.549
I can get a taste of
all 48 versions in one second.

03:36.966 --> 03:39.009
In other words,
if I can withstand her attack

03:39.010 --> 03:41.805
for just one second in
my Vollständig form,

03:42.514 --> 03:45.058
I'll be infected 48 times.

03:47.060 --> 03:51.272
Then all I need... is time to analyze
and acquire immunity.

03:52.232 --> 03:53.149
Oh, and...

03:53.858 --> 03:58.154
Maybe there's a way to alter
her Spiritual Pressure even more,

03:58.446 --> 03:59.698
but it won't do any good.

04:00.448 --> 04:03.117
Just so you don't waste
any time and effort,

04:03.118 --> 04:04.493
out of kindness...

04:04.494 --> 04:07.706
I'll tell you the capabilities
of my Vollständig.

04:08.164 --> 04:13.712
My Vollständig, Hass Hein adapts
to the changes in a poison.

04:14.379 --> 04:17.006
No matter how much the surface
layer of a poison changes,

04:17.007 --> 04:18.549
if the base is the same,

04:18.550 --> 04:22.262
Hass Hein can alter the immunity
and instantly nullify it.

04:22.887 --> 04:24.639
Was that was too wordy?

04:24.973 --> 04:26.850
But you get it, right?

04:27.559 --> 04:28.767
From here on out,

04:28.768 --> 04:32.063
the both of you can change your
Spiritual Pressures all you want.

04:32.897 --> 04:37.110
But you won't be able to put
a scratch on me.

04:37.944 --> 04:40.989
So, what will you do,
Kisuke Urahara?

04:41.364 --> 04:42.365
Don't tell me...

04:42.490 --> 04:45.702
Just because I negated
all your moves from 1 to 10,

04:46.161 --> 04:48.913
that you're at your wit's end!

04:54.044 --> 04:55.962
Don't be so surprised.

04:56.212 --> 04:57.464
I'm just making sure.

04:58.131 --> 05:00.091
I divided the Bereich.

05:01.092 --> 05:03.887
I'm not fond of speaking
in absolutes, you see.

05:04.763 --> 05:08.767
People who do, appear unsure
of themselves, don't they?

05:09.309 --> 05:11.978
I want to be a man
who's in control.

05:13.521 --> 05:14.939
But I will say this.

05:15.815 --> 05:20.528
It is absolutely impossible
to escape this Gift Bereich.

05:21.529 --> 05:24.866
You really don't want us to escape,
do you?

05:25.075 --> 05:27.744
Of course not.
Why even ask?

05:28.036 --> 05:29.537
Me and you are enemies.

05:30.080 --> 05:33.041
Well, I hate to be
the one to say this,

05:33.416 --> 05:37.545
but you didn't seem to me like
a guy who acts out of loyalty.

05:38.088 --> 05:39.964
Now that's rude.

05:40.340 --> 05:43.927
I like to think I have twice
the loyalty of a Pomeranian.

05:44.719 --> 05:46.971
But you're not wrong...

05:47.430 --> 05:49.224
Loyalty isn't everything.

05:50.350 --> 05:52.519
I'm interested in His Majesty.

05:53.853 --> 05:57.232
When I say "interested,"
does that sound condescending?

05:57.732 --> 05:59.526
Of course,
I don't mean it that way.

06:00.652 --> 06:04.072
The World of the Living,
Hueco Mundo, Soul Society...

06:04.739 --> 06:06.865
Destroying three entire worlds...

06:06.866 --> 06:09.452
...then aiming to build something new!

06:09.786 --> 06:12.497
Who else but His Majesty
could do that?

06:13.081 --> 06:15.250
Let's say,
if we lose His Majesty here...

06:15.667 --> 06:19.379
do you think anybody else like him
would emerge to take his place?

06:20.338 --> 06:21.673
Kisuke Urahara...

06:22.173 --> 06:23.717
You're a smart guy...

06:24.342 --> 06:26.970
You look like a man who has seen
everything there is to see.

06:27.178 --> 06:29.139
Aren't you even a bit curious?

06:29.848 --> 06:34.102
What will His Majesty create after
he destroys the Three Worlds?

06:34.602 --> 06:36.813
Don't you want to see
what it will be?

06:39.983 --> 06:42.527
You're still able to
move that quickly?

06:43.278 --> 06:45.905
That's impressive
inside this Gift Bereich.

06:46.948 --> 06:48.992
No, I don't think I do.

06:49.534 --> 06:51.285
Is that your answer
to my earlier question?

06:51.286 --> 06:52.954
That's too bad.

06:53.204 --> 06:56.458
I thought you'd be more like me.

06:56.624 --> 06:59.002
Perhaps Captain Kurotsuchi
might have said

06:59.586 --> 07:02.964
he wanted to see something new.

07:04.007 --> 07:05.341
Mayuri Kurotsuchi, huh...?

07:05.342 --> 07:06.760
But even in his case,

07:07.177 --> 07:10.722
it doesn't mean he'd want to see
what Yhwach creates.

07:11.264 --> 07:13.932
If you want to see something created
that nobody's ever seen before,

07:13.933 --> 07:15.310
it should be made
by your own hand.

07:15.727 --> 07:17.771
That's how scientists are.

07:20.023 --> 07:21.649
I see.

07:21.816 --> 07:24.110
I don't hate that answer.

07:24.778 --> 07:28.698
Still, I'd rather see
His Majesty's version!

07:28.865 --> 07:30.158
Gift Ring!

07:32.577 --> 07:33.536
<i>It disappeared?!</i>

07:39.042 --> 07:42.878
I use Gift Ring on guys
who are ridiculously strong

07:42.879 --> 07:45.882
on whom the Death Dealing
doesn't work.

07:46.049 --> 07:46.883
It's effect...

07:47.467 --> 07:50.387
focuses the ability of
the Death Dealing on a single point

07:50.929 --> 07:52.721
that's been pierced with
pinpoint accuracy

07:52.722 --> 07:54.891
and instantly killing
that precise section.

07:57.936 --> 08:01.106
It's your fault
for being too strong.

08:01.314 --> 08:03.358
Lowering the lethal dose
did no good.

08:03.525 --> 08:05.777
Eliminating all your moves
didn't do it.

08:06.820 --> 08:09.738
So, destroying
every single organ of yours

08:09.739 --> 08:11.950
is the only way left to kill you.

08:12.742 --> 08:14.035
You've got me here...

08:14.703 --> 08:17.122
You're really hellbent
on killing me!

08:18.915 --> 08:20.458
Guess I have no choice.

08:23.503 --> 08:24.546
Bankai.

08:39.394 --> 08:42.105
Kannon-Biraki Benihime Aratame.

08:43.064 --> 08:45.734
Whoa...
What is that?

08:46.609 --> 08:47.944
That's a Bankai?

08:48.737 --> 08:49.863
Your Bankai...

08:50.196 --> 08:54.159
wasn't in the information
I received from His Majesty.

08:54.784 --> 08:58.955
This is the first time I've used it
among present company.

08:59.831 --> 09:02.208
I see... that's how it is.

09:02.834 --> 09:06.838
So, I might as well ask...
What does it do?

09:07.088 --> 09:08.964
You're actually asking?

09:08.965 --> 09:10.467
I'm not telling.

09:10.884 --> 09:13.052
Well, okay, I figured.

09:13.053 --> 09:15.680
It's just kinda scary confronting it
without knowing what it does.

09:16.097 --> 09:17.265
I get it.

09:17.515 --> 09:21.186
But you'll find out soon enough.

09:25.273 --> 09:26.941
<i>What the... hell is this?!</i>

09:36.951 --> 09:38.495
You're so calm!

09:39.079 --> 09:42.707
Most people are so surprised
that they try to cut off their arm.

09:43.625 --> 09:47.754
As you've now realized,
my Bankai's effect is "ranged."

09:49.005 --> 09:51.800
I don't have the guts
to cut my arm off.

09:52.300 --> 09:55.136
You might have realized
from the first strike...

09:55.428 --> 09:56.429
<i>What...</i>

09:56.596 --> 09:57.931
<i>What is he doing?</i>

09:58.515 --> 10:01.476
Kannon-Biraki Benihime
Aratame's ability...

10:02.936 --> 10:05.563
is reconstructing
whatever it touches.

10:14.656 --> 10:16.533
What?! You can see?!

10:16.658 --> 10:19.035
But I killed your eyes instantly!

10:19.160 --> 10:20.370
I can see!

10:20.495 --> 10:22.580
They've been reconstructed,
you see...

10:49.024 --> 10:50.525
Ugh, I hate this.

10:50.942 --> 10:54.029
I really, really, really
really hate this!

10:54.696 --> 10:56.905
This has turned into
a clash of brute force,

10:56.906 --> 10:58.867
the kind of fight I hate!

10:59.159 --> 11:03.913
I finally dragged you onto my turf
to fight on my terms,

11:04.039 --> 11:07.083
then you go and mess it all up.

11:07.876 --> 11:10.295
You're a bad man, Kisuke Urahara.

11:13.173 --> 11:14.007
But,

11:14.174 --> 11:16.092
you're not perfect!

11:16.593 --> 11:18.386
You haven't forgotten, have you?

11:19.346 --> 11:23.975
My Gift Ball Deluxe is
an inescapable fortress of poison!

11:24.392 --> 11:27.228
You're able to breathe inside of it

11:27.479 --> 11:29.939
only because I'm moderating it!

11:58.843 --> 12:01.096
Give me a break, here!

12:01.388 --> 12:03.514
You're not going to raise
the concentration

12:03.515 --> 12:05.308
of Gift Ball Deluxe even more,
are you?!

12:08.937 --> 12:13.692
As it is,
I can just barely crawl...

12:13.983 --> 12:15.484
That's rich coming from you.

12:15.485 --> 12:16.778
I already know!

12:17.654 --> 12:22.075
Your Bankai is dangerous even
if you're crawling on the ground!

12:22.242 --> 12:24.953
Impressive.
You're quite perceptive.

12:25.578 --> 12:27.622
But it's already too late.

12:34.879 --> 12:36.464
What happened?

12:37.632 --> 12:39.009
It's been bugging me...

12:39.926 --> 12:44.305
You said that this Gift Ball Deluxe
was inescapable,

12:45.056 --> 12:47.058
but you did not say
it was impenetrable.

12:48.101 --> 12:49.269
So, I thought as a test...

12:49.811 --> 12:54.149
Why not create a direct path
into the ball from the outside?

12:55.150 --> 12:57.360
Thank you for your help...

12:58.445 --> 12:59.571
Mr. Grimmjow.

13:09.497 --> 13:10.832
So, you're...

13:11.666 --> 13:13.918
moving around again.

13:14.544 --> 13:16.129
Impressive.

13:16.671 --> 13:19.758
I underestimated you.

13:20.342 --> 13:24.971
What? You're still alive even with
a crushed heart?

13:25.847 --> 13:29.434
I healed him.
On my way here.

13:30.393 --> 13:33.772
The Arrancars who had their masks
torn off by Aizen

13:34.064 --> 13:37.107
can completely transform
their Spiritual Pressures

13:37.108 --> 13:40.111
from an Arrancar's to
a Hollow's using Resurrección.

13:40.612 --> 13:44.157
I thought that might be
useful in battle.

13:44.991 --> 13:48.453
You saw that far ahead?

13:49.454 --> 13:50.455
No.

13:51.039 --> 13:51.998
I told you...

13:52.290 --> 13:55.168
I thought it might come in handy
during battle.

13:55.794 --> 13:57.379
So, I prepared for it.

13:58.213 --> 14:01.049
Take a thousand precautions and
if even one is successful... perfect.

14:01.424 --> 14:04.969
Prepare for
every single possibility.

14:05.178 --> 14:07.097
That's how I am.

14:07.806 --> 14:09.391
That's insane.

14:09.933 --> 14:10.934
How so?

14:12.018 --> 14:13.185
This is a battle.

14:13.186 --> 14:15.270
You lose, you die.

14:15.271 --> 14:17.981
Preparing yourself to death,
to avoid death...

14:17.982 --> 14:19.818
It's something we all do,
don't you think?

14:20.944 --> 14:22.821
You have a point.

14:23.029 --> 14:25.323
I think I finally...

14:26.157 --> 14:27.366
understand why...

14:27.367 --> 14:30.620
you're so frightening...

14:34.332 --> 14:37.502
Stubborn bastard.
Just die already.

14:38.044 --> 14:39.254
Mr. Grimmjow!

14:40.088 --> 14:44.300
Killing your enemy was the extent
of our agreement.

14:44.801 --> 14:46.678
Our contract's done.

14:49.597 --> 14:52.017
What the... hell is this?

14:52.267 --> 14:55.895
Oh, I forgot to tell you something...

14:56.604 --> 14:57.689
Bastard! You're still...

14:58.106 --> 14:59.858
When I die,

15:00.608 --> 15:04.029
the effect of Gift Ball Deluxe
intensifies!

15:05.363 --> 15:07.073
The lock...

15:07.407 --> 15:11.076
...that I unconsciously kept on it
out of fear, to protect myself

15:11.077 --> 15:13.288
is removed.

15:15.957 --> 15:19.877
I would pay my respects to you...

15:19.878 --> 15:22.839
But there's nothing
I can do about it.

15:23.465 --> 15:27.927
I'm guessing you two don't have
the energy left to run.

15:28.094 --> 15:29.929
Sorry about that...

15:30.388 --> 15:31.639
That being said...

15:32.265 --> 15:33.850
Knowing you,

15:34.476 --> 15:36.603
I'm sure you've got an
answer for this, right?

15:38.980 --> 15:40.899
Damn it.

15:41.399 --> 15:42.942
It pisses me off so much.

15:43.818 --> 15:46.029
So, I won't say...

15:46.571 --> 15:48.406
it's fatal...

15:57.874 --> 15:58.916
Damn it!

15:58.917 --> 16:03.838
I'm not letting this thing kill me!

16:05.382 --> 16:06.591
Amazing...

16:06.966 --> 16:10.637
One of the Five Possibilities
he mentioned really happened...

16:11.471 --> 16:14.724
I think there are four
Spiritual Pressures inside.

16:15.016 --> 16:16.393
It will take two round trips.

16:17.060 --> 16:18.228
Where's the entrance?

16:19.229 --> 16:20.605
There?!
It's tiny!

16:21.773 --> 16:24.734
I was actually hoping
to go with Ichigo, but...

16:32.033 --> 16:33.910
Is this it for me?

16:38.456 --> 16:42.168
I'm sorry to leave the rest
up to you like this...

16:43.753 --> 16:46.339
Mr. Kurosaki... Miss Kuchiki...

16:46.881 --> 16:48.091
Everyone...

17:07.986 --> 17:09.154
Do you feel that, Inoue?

17:10.572 --> 17:11.573
Yes.

17:12.824 --> 17:14.200
It's behind that door.

17:15.910 --> 17:16.745
Yes.

17:18.705 --> 17:19.789
We'll go in two on one.

17:20.957 --> 17:22.167
It may be kinda unfair...

17:23.043 --> 17:24.461
I'll leave you
in charge of defense.

17:25.754 --> 17:27.297
I'm counting on you, Inoue.

17:29.841 --> 17:30.717
Okay!

17:32.510 --> 17:33.511
<i>It's finally happening.</i>

17:34.888 --> 17:35.805
<i>Finally...</i>

17:36.931 --> 17:37.891
<i>Finally...</i>

17:41.936 --> 17:44.564
<i>I can finally fight
to protect Kurosaki!</i>

17:50.862 --> 17:51.988
Good of you to come.

17:52.864 --> 17:54.199
I've been waiting.

17:54.824 --> 17:56.534
My son of darkness.

18:00.747 --> 18:02.165
Aren't you going to
draw your sword?

18:02.874 --> 18:05.335
That leaves you quite vulnerable...

18:06.544 --> 18:08.588
...is what I want to say, but...

18:09.464 --> 18:12.884
you're not exactly vulnerable,
are you?

18:13.593 --> 18:15.177
It's like I can almost see

18:15.178 --> 18:17.389
your overflowing Spiritual Pressure
take form.

18:18.556 --> 18:20.225
You've grown strong.

18:20.934 --> 18:21.934
No, I should say...

18:21.935 --> 18:25.063
That is the power
you're supposed to have.

18:26.606 --> 18:28.191
Now come!

18:28.817 --> 18:30.402
Will you come from the right?

18:30.735 --> 18:32.362
Or from the left?

18:32.946 --> 18:34.906
I'm waiting in anticipation.

18:38.118 --> 18:40.787
What's the matter?
Aren't you going to strike at me?

18:40.954 --> 18:44.499
I want to enjoy this long-awaited
talk between father and child.

18:46.251 --> 18:47.335
You're...

18:47.877 --> 18:48.878
not my father.

18:49.671 --> 18:51.423
Ah, you speak of Isshin Kurosaki?

18:51.881 --> 18:54.592
He was just a
stand-in father.

18:55.135 --> 18:57.470
I'm sure you've already been told...

18:57.595 --> 19:00.390
of the origin of your power.

19:00.682 --> 19:01.766
I have.

19:01.891 --> 19:03.101
So what?

19:03.601 --> 19:05.478
You're not my father!

19:05.812 --> 19:07.939
You're the man
who killed one of my parents!

19:08.189 --> 19:09.648
Your mother?

19:09.649 --> 19:11.234
Don't be pathetic!

19:16.781 --> 19:18.616
Getsugatensho!

19:47.687 --> 19:49.314
<i>Simply being able to
"see" the future</i>

19:49.522 --> 19:51.149
<i>doesn't mean he can "win."</i>

19:52.275 --> 19:54.234
<i>I simply have to attack
in a way he can't defend</i>

19:54.235 --> 19:55.820
<i>even if he knows it's coming.</i>

19:57.280 --> 20:01.576
I'm going to send you
and The Almighty to the grave.

20:02.410 --> 20:05.455
I will rectify your ignorance,
Uryu Ishida.

20:06.623 --> 20:09.417
Simply grasping everything
about a battlefield

20:10.043 --> 20:12.545
is a far cry from "seeing"
how a battle unfolds.

20:13.421 --> 20:18.009
You sent Ichigo Kurosaki to fight
the most important battle.

20:18.677 --> 20:21.011
You probably calculated on Ichigo
defeating His Majesty

20:21.012 --> 20:23.014
when he is without The Almighty.

20:23.890 --> 20:25.225
That was a reasonable strategy.

20:25.934 --> 20:27.727
But a mistaken one.

20:39.614 --> 20:41.074
The power of the Soul King!

21:05.056 --> 21:07.100
What is there to be sad about?

21:07.600 --> 21:10.145
She died as she was supposed to.

21:10.979 --> 21:14.441
She gave birth to you
and lived for me.

21:14.899 --> 21:16.234
What more could she want?

21:16.651 --> 21:19.029
There is no greater happiness!

21:24.659 --> 21:25.660
Kurosaki!

21:28.204 --> 21:29.539
Kurosaki!

21:32.542 --> 21:34.419
Our conversation is finished.

21:34.836 --> 21:36.046
It was fun.

21:37.714 --> 21:39.007
Now...

21:39.424 --> 21:41.801
Shall we fight, Ichigo?

21:42.344 --> 21:46.222
It was a smart choice to focus on
The Almighty.

21:46.765 --> 21:47.640
However...

21:48.099 --> 21:51.269
It was overly arrogant of you
to try to measure His Majesty.

21:56.858 --> 21:58.151
The Almighty.

22:05.075 --> 22:09.245
What was it that you thought you knew
about me, Uryu Ishida?

22:15.543 --> 22:17.629
Despair begins now.

22:28.181 --> 22:29.474
Wait, Kurosaki!

22:33.978 --> 22:36.106
A reckless charge.

22:36.398 --> 22:39.359
What did you bring that woman for?

22:39.901 --> 22:42.529
Did hatred make you
lose control of yourself?

22:43.863 --> 22:45.407
Don't be so impatient.

22:49.035 --> 22:52.663
You will eventually be consumed
by me and die,

22:52.664 --> 22:55.250
but it's no fun
if you rush to your death.

22:56.126 --> 22:58.419
Do you have any idea
how much time and

22:58.420 --> 23:01.381
how many miracles it took
to create you?

23:02.674 --> 23:03.508
Don't be impatient.

23:03.842 --> 23:06.177
Don't treat your life so lightly.

23:07.095 --> 23:08.346
Your body...

23:08.513 --> 23:10.097
Your power...

23:10.098 --> 23:12.142
They do not belong to you, Ichigo.

23:12.809 --> 23:17.022
Expend all of your power
and die, Ichigo!

23:25.405 --> 23:26.697
<i>Retracing memories</i>

23:26.698 --> 23:30.409
<i>An unexpected gaze</i>

23:30.410 --> 23:32.911
<i>The world I didn't want</i>

23:32.912 --> 23:34.830
<i>I've started breaking it down</i>

23:34.831 --> 23:37.541
<i>Lean on each other and face forward</i>

23:37.542 --> 23:40.252
<i>I want to change my fate</i>

23:40.253 --> 23:43.422
<i>All the voices shout</i>

23:43.423 --> 23:45.550
<i>The sound rang out</i>

24:00.982 --> 24:03.525
<i>I saw countless scattered shadows</i>

24:03.526 --> 24:05.862
<i>and I laughed</i>

24:06.029 --> 24:08.322
<i>A world that's lost its color</i>

24:08.323 --> 24:10.699
<i>I'll illuminate it again</i>

24:10.700 --> 24:13.369
<i>Broken and lamenting</i>

24:13.370 --> 24:15.996
<i>The end of the dream</i>

24:15.997 --> 24:20.501
<i>Shaking free from it over and over again
with a still-connected heart</i>

24:20.502 --> 24:26.173
<i>I'll protect today,
the path I've walked all this time</i>

24:26.174 --> 24:27.217
<i>Break it</i>

24:27.342 --> 24:29.843
<i>Tear the future apart, call my name</i>

24:29.844 --> 24:32.846
<i>Turn your back on your predetermined past</i>

24:32.847 --> 24:35.724
<i>Today keeps playing with fate</i>

24:35.725 --> 24:37.768
<i>Reclaim it here and now</i>

24:37.769 --> 24:40.396
<i>To the ends of the earth, an unseen dream</i>

24:40.397 --> 24:43.190
<i>With eyes that know the strength
that lies in words</i>

24:43.191 --> 24:46.235
<i>Notice the distorted spiral</i>

24:46.236 --> 24:49.781
<i>My fate has been set in motion</i>

25:01.209 --> 25:02.877
<i>Even the scattering of these petals...</i>

25:04.713 --> 25:06.756
<i>Is a miracle.</i>
